   "text": "Only 1D/2D experiments; bound shows curse of dimensionality limiting applicability",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q1.2",
   "reviewer": "Q1",
   "text": "No memory and runtime comparison with MLP and KAN baselines",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
